  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/exline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/73838725-ba9a-49e1-83b8-c87b658405cb.webp\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">您有兴趣支持我和我模组开发吗？如果是，我建议尝试 BisectHosting。作为新客户，请使用优惠码：EXLINE，在您的第一个月游戏服务器费用中获得 25% 的折扣。凭借 24/7 的支持和快速响应时间，您可以期待出色的服务来满足您的所有游戏需求。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/976/banner_hammers.png\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UVGJGyqbv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/993245467162972220?color=blue&label=Discord&style=plastic&logo=discord\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/exlinegames/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Curseforge-Projects-blue?style=plastic&logo=curseforge\" width=\"226\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fexline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Profle-blue?style=plastic&logo=modrinth\" width=\"185\" height=\"28\"></a></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>战锤<br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模组添加了一种新的工具/武器：战锤。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">比剑更强，但挥动速度较慢。把握好时机，粉碎你的敌人。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">战锤还可以充当镐子，因此你可以用它来挖矿。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">下载</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/408/905/forgeicon.png\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Forge 版本 (v1.0.1+) - <span style=\"color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/3843087\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19</a>, <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/3695180\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">1</span>.18.2</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge 版本 - 旧版 - (v1.0.0) - </span><span style=\"color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/3555414\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18</a>, <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/3432201\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.17.1</a>,&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/3383414\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.16.5</a>, </span><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/3155833\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.16.4</span></a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/408/904/fabricicon.png\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Fabric 版本 (v1.0.1+) - <span style=\"color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/4509047\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19<span style=\"color:#00f\">.4</span></a>, <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/3874797\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19</a>, <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/3695179\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">1.18.2</span></a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric 版本 - 旧版 - (v1.0.0) - <span style=\"color:#00f\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/3557158\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/3557156\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.17.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/war-hammers-forge-and-fabric/files/3155836\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.16.4</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/966/crafting_recipes.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/957/wooden_warhammer.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/958/stone_warhammer.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/959/iron_warhammer.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/960/gold_warhammer.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/961/diamond_warhammer.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/962/netherite_warhammer.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>要在生存模式下制作黑曜石战锤，你需要拥有黑曜石装备模组。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/395/14/obsidian_equipment.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>如果你想要更多装备，请查看这些！每一个都会添加一种新的可制作战锤。（点击展开）<br></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/394/948/banner_amethyst.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/394/982/banner_bone.png\"></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/995/banner_copperequipment.png\"></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-emerald-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/413/440/emerald_banner.png\"></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>感谢</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>ilBobo94</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> - </span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">意大利语翻译</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fexlinemods.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/b3784fc8-73a8-4ed5-9033-feb6c6f2806c/blob-19e676c.png/:/rs=w:149,h:149,cg:true,m/cr=w:149,h:149/qt=q:95\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"149\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">需要 Minecraft 服务器托管？&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">无需再找，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/exline\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting。</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">我现在正式成为 Bisect Hosting 的赞助商，并将通过下方链接和代码产生的任何购买获得佣金。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">使用优惠码 EXLINE 可在首次购买时享受